    "https://mcgill.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/mcgill_careers/job/Sherbrooke-680/Fall-2026-Grader---ISON_JR0000079554": {
      "title": "Fall 2026 Grader - ISON",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-09-08\nPosted: Posted 6 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nPlease refer to the  How to Apply for a Job (for External Candidates)   job aid for instructions on how to apply. If you are an active McGill employee (ie: currently in an active contract or position at McGill University), do not apply through this Career Site. Login to your McGill Workday account and apply to this posting using the Find Jobs report (type Find Jobs in the search bar). Hiring Unit: Ingram School of Nursing Position: Grader Employment Period: September 1, 2026 – January 8, 2027 Rate of Pay: $18.00/hour The following Grader positions are available for the Fall 2026 term. Graders will support course coordinators with grading responsibilities for the courses listed below. Grading/course-related responsibilities as assigned by the course coordinator. NUR 221 001 Course Coordinator: M. Di Feo Hours: 115 Positions Available: 1 NUR 224 001 Course Coordinator: M. Purden Hours: 100 Positions Available: 1 NUR 224 002 Course Coordinator: H. Marchand Hours: 100 Positions Available: 1 NUR 224 003 Course Coordinator: M. Purden Hours: 100 Positions Available: 1 NUR 224 004 Course Coordinator: H. Marchand Hours: 100 Positions Available: 1 NUR 235 x 535 – Lecture Course Coordinator: B. Fernandes Hours: 111 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 001 Course Coordinator: N. Ponzoni Hours: 99 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 002 Course Coordinator: R. Antonacci Hours: 99 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 003 Course Coordinator: N. Ponzoni Hours: 99 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 004 Course Coordinator: R. Antonacci Hours: 99 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 005 Course Coordinator: R. Antonacci Hours: 99 Positions Available: 1 NUR 318 020 – Online Course Coordinator: A. Michalovic Hours: 125 Positions Available: 1 or 2 NUR 318 023 – Online Course Coordinator: C. Marchionni Hours: 125 Positions Available: 1 or 2 NUR 323/623 Course Coordinators: F. Fernandes and R. Garland Hours: 62 Positions Available: 1 NUR 325 001 Course Coordinator: A. Cervantes Hours: 94 Positions Available: 1 NUR 325 002 Course Coordinator: M. Damian Hours: 94 Positions Available: 1 NUR 325 003 Course Coordinator: S. Sinnathurai Hours: 94 Positions Available: 1 NUR 338 – Lecture Course Coordinators: M. Damian, C. Ricci, and A. Zeagman Hours: 206 Positions Available: 2 or 3 NUR 424 001 Course Coordinators: C.-A. Miller and J. Bonneau Hours: 135 Positions Available: 1 or 2 NUR 424 020 – Online Course Coordinator: J. Bonneau Hours: 77 Positions Available: 1 Application Information Interested candidates should indicate the course(s) for which they are applying when submitting their application. Before applying, please note that to work at McGill University, you must be both authorized to work in Canada and willing to work in the province of Quebec at the campus where the position is based / located. McGill University is an English-language university where most teaching and research activities are conducted in the English language, thereby requiring English communication both verbally and in writing. Hourly Salary: $18.00 Position Start Date: 2026-08-19 Position End Date: 2027-01-08 Deadline to Apply: 2026-09-14 McGill University hires on the basis of merit and is strongly committed to equity and diversity within its community. We welcome applications from racialized persons/visible minorities, women, Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, ethnic minorities, and persons of minority sexual orientations and gender identities, as well as from all qualified candidates with the skills and knowledge to productively engage with diverse communities. McGill implements an employment equity program and encourages members of designated groups to self-identify. Persons with disabilities who anticipate needing accommodations for any part of the application process may contact, in confidence, accessibilityrequest.hr@mcgill.ca ."
